 **讲义完整情境**：Class 9 CFO case: The firm holds 1 million USDC and must pay a US\$800,000 invoice today. Issuer redemption at par: 800,000 USDC → US\$800,000. The Circle Mint route requires an eligible account. It works for this invoice only if the bank funds arrive by the deadline. Market sale at a US\$0.90 bid: 888,888.89 USDC → US\$800,000. Assume the dealer can deliver bank funds today. The firm sells more tokens to meet the same cash obligation. If the supplier wants HK dollars, USD/HKD conversion is a separate step in either route.
 
 **中文解析与来源地位**：这是讲义的压力报价假设，省略费用，不是当前 USDC 市价。按面值且今天能到账，交回 800,000 USDC，剩 200,000；市场报价是每 USDC 0.90 美元，要交 $800,000/0.90=888,888.888\ldots$ USDC，约剩 111,111.11。多耗约 88,888.89 USDC，并不等于额外损失了同额美元。
